==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fr|en}} {{term|graphologie|lang=fr}}, coined by [[w:Jean-Hippolyte Michon|Jean-Hippolyte Michon]], from {{etyl|grc|en}} [[γραφή]] (''graphe''), "writing" + {{term|-logie||study of|lang=fr}}.

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|-|graphologies}}

# the study of [[handwriting]], especially as a means of [[analyzing]] [[character]]

